{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"sections\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他离开熟悉的生活，起初觉得终于不用委屈自己\",\"accent\":\"终于不用委屈自己\",\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S01-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"可他很快空落落的，仍想往前却不知如何安心\",\"accent\":\"空落落的\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S01-2\",\"S01-3\"],\"at\":8}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"声音像烟雾往高处散，也像一声召唤，停顿里还等着回声\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S01-B1\"],\"bars\":\"1-6\",\"at\":16},{\"text\":\"他像强撑着挺直背脊，心里却想停下来\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S01-B2\"],\"bars\":\"1-23\",\"at\":22},{\"text\":\"他分不清这份失落是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S01-B3\"],\"bars\":\"1-23\",\"at\":30},{\"text\":\"像刚醒来，冷空里胸口发紧，颤抖的手摸空\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S01-B4\"],\"bars\":\"1-23\",\"at\":38},{\"text\":\"旧日场景忽然清晰，身体先记起舞步，却回不到现在\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S01-B5\"],\"bars\":\"9-23\",\"at\":46}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"沉重开头后声音上扬，短句被停顿截断\",\"from\":[\"S01-B1\",\"S01-B3\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"1-23\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他舍不得从前自在的日子，一想到不能再那样过就发慌\",\"accent\":\"舍不得\",\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S02-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"他赶紧想起受过的气，提醒自己当初为何要走\",\"accent\":\"受过的气\",\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S02-2\"],\"at\":8},{\"text\":\"可他还是不甘心，难道好日子也得一并丢掉吗\",\"accent\":\"不甘心\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S02-3\"],\"at\":16}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"远处旧歌只能模糊哼几句，像腿脚发虚地挪动舞步\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S02-B1\",\"S02-B2\"],\"bars\":\"24-65\",\"at\":24},{\"text\":\"舞步像面向众人的庄严，歌声却像私下哼唱\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S02-B1\"],\"bars\":\"24-65\",\"at\":30},{\"text\":\"珍惜的东西仿佛还在，却已不能照旧拥有\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S02-B1\"],\"bars\":\"24-65\",\"at\":36},{\"text\":\"他抬头反复说没事，越说越显出在意，也不甘心就这样消失\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S02-B4\",\"S02-B5\"],\"bars\":\"44-65\",\"at\":42}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"庄严步子下藏着不安，声音上推又退，呼吸渐急\",\"from\":[\"S02-B2\",\"S02-B3\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"24-65\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他心里还憋着气，却因想起被当作自己人而高兴\",\"accent\":\"高兴\",\"emotion\":\"欢喜\",\"from\":[\"S03-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"那点高兴很快变酸，离开后真会更好过吗\",\"accent\":\"变酸\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S03-2\"],\"at\":5}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"那一下若听得突出，就像重锤砸下，带着怒气\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S03-B1\"],\"bars\":\"66-91\",\"at\":10},{\"text\":\"夏日麦浪和微风浮现，像从前不必防备的亲近\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S03-B2\"],\"bars\":\"80-91\",\"at\":14},{\"text\":\"像暂时走开聊点别的，轻松却没解开伤口\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S03-B3\"],\"bars\":\"66-91\",\"at\":18},{\"text\":\"耳边像许多人絮语缠绕，脚下却像流沙抓不住重心\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S03-B4\"],\"bars\":\"66-91\",\"at\":22},{\"text\":\"前一刻的昂扬像在退潮，他怀疑自己是否真信了\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S03-B5\"],\"bars\":\"66-91\",\"at\":26}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"重击后忽强忽弱，前急后柔，声音重心漂移\",\"from\":[\"S03-B1\",\"S03-B2\",\"S03-B4\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"66-91\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"想起从前亲近的日子，他真盼着还能那样相处\",\"accent\":\"盼着\",\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S04-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"可那些委屈也翻上来，他开始追问当初走得对不对\",\"accent\":\"委屈\",\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S04-2\"],\"at\":4}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"回忆像有人独自轻声说话，带出感激柔情和短暂幸福\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S04-B1\"],\"bars\":\"92-107\",\"at\":8},{\"text\":\"那份坚定或许只是他努力想成为的样子\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S04-B1\"],\"bars\":\"92-115\",\"at\":12},{\"text\":\"过去太美好，想起反而刺痛，像被撕扯着后退\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S04-B2\"],\"bars\":\"92-115\",\"at\":16},{\"text\":\"细碎声音像乱了拍的心跳，脚步被催得飞快\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S04-B3\"],\"bars\":\"92-115\",\"at\":20},{\"text\":\"他不停往前赶，只为躲开没走会怎样的追问\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S04-B4\"],\"bars\":\"94-115\",\"at\":24}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"温暖声音忽然紧绷，细碎声音一路下滑\",\"from\":[\"S04-B2\",\"S04-B3\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"108-115\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他仍不服气，觉得当初那些气根本不该忍\",\"accent\":\"不服气\",\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S05-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"可他连开心的往事都不敢多想，觉得太委屈自己\",\"accent\":\"不敢多想\",\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S05-1\"],\"at\":7},{\"text\":\"争得累了，他想到自己已不在那些人身边只觉难受\",\"accent\":\"只觉难受\",\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S05-2\"],\"at\":14}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"夜色里像有两个影子，彼此低声说话\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S05-B1\"],\"bars\":\"116-147\",\"at\":21},{\"text\":\"温柔歌唱里仍有股劲，像在说这事不能算了\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S05-B2\"],\"bars\":\"116-127\",\"at\":28},{\"text\":\"旧日记忆又有了温度，可能来自某个人、故乡或旧生活\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S05-B3\"],\"bars\":\"116-147\",\"at\":35},{\"text\":\"脚下像地板忽然消失，松开的那口气只是抵抗累了\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S05-B4\",\"S05-B5\"],\"bars\":\"128-147\",\"at\":42}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"柔和声音仍被一股劲推着走\",\"from\":[\"S05-B2\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"116-127\"},{\"text\":\"快速声音渐渐放慢，最后只剩稀疏响声\",\"from\":[\"S05-B4\",\"S05-B5\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"128-147\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"难受慢慢缓下来，他想起有人在身边时有多轻松\",\"accent\":\"有多轻松\",\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S06-1\",\"S06-2\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"他想再过不用多说就亲近的日子，却怕再也没有\",\"accent\":\"怕再也没有\",\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S06-3\"],\"at\":8},{\"text\":\"那样的日子他确实拥有过，想起会暖一点但现实没变好\",\"accent\":\"想起会暖一点\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S06-4\",\"S06-B1\"],\"at\":16}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"像隔着玻璃听母亲哼摇篮曲，连呼吸都放轻一会儿\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S06-B1\"],\"bars\":\"148-180\",\"at\":24},{\"text\":\"他终于不用解释难过，压住的愿望、委屈和思念浮出来\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S06-B2\"],\"bars\":\"148-180\",\"at\":30},{\"text\":\"他像向遥远未知处祈求，心愿真切却未必有回应\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S06-B2\"],\"bars\":\"148-180\",\"at\":36},{\"text\":\"远处家园忽然亮起，像珍爱之物只想轻轻看着\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S06-B2\",\"S06-B4\"],\"bars\":\"148-180\",\"at\":42}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"庄严的声音绵延，歌声逐渐舒展又悬住\",\"from\":[\"S06-B1\",\"S06-B3\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"148-180\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"刚有点安心，他忽然怕以后遇难事还得独自扛\",\"accent\":\"独自扛\",\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S07-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"当初只想离开那些委屈，早知道会孤单还会走吗\",\"accent\":\"早知道会孤单\",\"emotion\":\"孤单\",\"from\":[\"S07-2\"],\"at\":8},{\"text\":\"他想找回亲近又不肯再受气，连当初的决心也找不着\",\"accent\":\"不肯再受气\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S07-3\"],\"at\":16}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"寒风吹开窗，把人从甜梦拽回严寒，脉搏猛跳\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S07-B1\"],\"bars\":\"182附近\",\"at\":24},{\"text\":\"祈祷般的静谧忽然被舞步截断，心里却未必好转\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S07-B2\"],\"bars\":\"182-197\",\"at\":30},{\"text\":\"心里像有东西不停翻转，想冲出去却找不到出口\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S07-B3\"],\"bars\":\"198-205\",\"at\":36},{\"text\":\"熟悉的舞蹈和日常动作闯进来，亲切得让人看见失去\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S07-B4\"],\"bars\":\"181-205\",\"at\":42}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"细长颤动后，熟悉舞步闯入却不再完整\",\"from\":[\"S07-B1\",\"S07-B2\",\"S07-B5\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"182-197\"},{\"text\":\"连续颤动的声音越积越紧\",\"from\":[\"S07-B3\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"198-205\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他先把回头的事放一边，可回忆不能陪他扛难处\",\"accent\":\"回忆不能陪他扛难处\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S08-1\",\"S08-2\"],\"at\":0}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"想起曾被当作自己人，心里暖了一会儿\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S08-B1\"],\"bars\":\"206-213\",\"at\":4},{\"text\":\"像临走前回头看一眼，温柔里满是不舍\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S08-B2\"],\"bars\":\"206-213\",\"at\":8},{\"text\":\"胸口仿佛终于吸进一口气，却只喘息一瞬\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S08-B3\"],\"bars\":\"206-213\",\"at\":12}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"宽广声音短暂回来又退去\",\"from\":[\"S08-B1\",\"S08-B2\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"206-213\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他忽然分不清，想回去是舍不得亲近还是怕孤单\",\"accent\":\"分不清\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S09-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"这个念头让他一阵心慌，连往下想都不敢\",\"accent\":\"一阵心慌\",\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S09-1\",\"S09-2\"],\"at\":5}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"像从另一面重新看见同一扇门，脚步还没聚起\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S09-B1\"],\"bars\":\"214-215\",\"at\":10},{\"text\":\"像重新遇见当初那个不知怎么办的自己\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S09-B2\"],\"bars\":\"214-215\",\"at\":15},{\"text\":\"这回他知道那个人经历过什么，问题仍没答案\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S09-B2\"],\"bars\":\"214-215\",\"at\":20}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"沉重开头忽然闪回，落稳后又漂去\",\"from\":[\"S09-B1\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"214-215\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他慢慢觉得最舍不得的，是被当作自己人的日子\",\"accent\":\"最舍不得\",\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S10-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"那些委屈不能当没发生，光凭舍不得他不敢放心回去\",\"accent\":\"不能当没发生\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S10-2\",\"S10-3\"],\"at\":4}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"熟悉的声音像歌舞残片，也像破碎的摇篮曲\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S10-B1\"],\"bars\":\"216-225\",\"at\":8},{\"text\":\"像忽然失重，整个人悬着辨不清方向\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S10-B2\"],\"bars\":\"221-225\",\"at\":12},{\"text\":\"他问以后怎么过，重要往事无力重讲，眼下也不踏实\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S10-3\",\"S10-B3\",\"S10-B4\"],\"bars\":\"216-225\",\"at\":16}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"熟悉声音断断续续浮现\",\"from\":[\"S10-B1\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"216-225\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他明知回去未必找回亲近，还是忍不住想万一呢\",\"accent\":\"万一呢\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S11-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"他不愿只凭希望回去忍让，想先把眼下过稳\",\"accent\":\"把眼下过稳\",\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S11-2\",\"S11-3\"],\"at\":5},{\"text\":\"他仍怕独自扛难事，却不想因害怕收回打算\",\"accent\":\"不想因害怕收回打算\",\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S11-4\"],\"at\":10}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"害怕还在，步子渐渐聚拢，像困兽仍往前顶\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S11-B1\",\"S11-B2\",\"S11-B3\"],\"bars\":\"226-241\",\"at\":14}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"沉重声浪涌来，重击仍在落下\",\"from\":[\"S11-B1\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"226-241\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"他不再逼自己选边，当初的气确实不该忍\",\"accent\":\"不再逼自己选边\",\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S12-1\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"他记得那段日子真开心，也不怪自己离开\",\"accent\":\"真开心\",\"emotion\":\"欢喜\",\"from\":[\"S12-1\",\"S12-2\"],\"at\":4},{\"text\":\"他不愿只为陪伴回头，愿带着想念继续过日子\",\"accent\":\"带着想念\",\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S12-2\"],\"at\":8}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"他仍怕以后一个人熬\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S12-2\"],\"bars\":\"242-253\",\"at\":12},{\"text\":\"他像和众人一起昂扬，也主动站稳，脚下却忽然一斜\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S12-B1\",\"S12-B2\",\"S12-B3\"],\"bars\":\"242-253\",\"at\":16}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"熟悉声音雷鸣般回来，随后变色\",\"from\":[\"S12-B1\",\"S12-B3\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"242-253\"}]},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"big\":[{\"text\":\"想起从前亲近的日子，他盼着再遇见也怕等很久\",\"accent\":\"怕等很久\",\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S13-1\",\"S13-3\"],\"at\":0},{\"text\":\"他有了劲头想把日子过好，不再整天和过去较劲\",\"accent\":\"把日子过好\",\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S13-2\"],\"at\":6},{\"text\":\"他会珍惜把他当自己人的人，独自也不为留人咽委屈\",\"accent\":\"不为留人咽委屈\",\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S13-4\"],\"at\":12}],\"small\":[{\"text\":\"柔软歌声涌进宏大光亮，像故土和共同记忆被照亮\",\"after\":0,\"from\":[\"S13-B1\"],\"bars\":\"254-270\",\"at\":18},{\"text\":\"身体像被一股气流推着跑，兴奋得来不及喘息\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S13-B2\"],\"bars\":\"269-280\",\"at\":24},{\"text\":\"他心里慢慢静下来，像是在问成功稳不稳，也像终于能喘口气\",\"after\":1,\"from\":[\"S13-3\",\"S13-B3\"],\"bars\":\"281-287\",\"at\":30},{\"text\":\"低处两声耳语后，高音像寒星，也像决定或梦醒\",\"after\":2,\"from\":[\"S13-B4\",\"S13-B5\"],\"bars\":\"末尾几小节、286-288\",\"at\":36}],\"notes\":[{\"text\":\"柔软声音变得宏大，亮声迅速冲出\",\"from\":[\"S13-B1\",\"S13-B2\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"254-280\"},{\"text\":\"细碎声音渐收，低处轻响后高处亮起\",\"from\":[\"S13-B3\",\"S13-B4\"],\"pt\":\"\",\"bars\":\"281-287、末尾几小节\"}]} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c4f98454-b1d2-4c4a-9337-45a464951ef7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T170738375872Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1755.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T17:36:54.257847+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1de7dbec41279be9736742f17acbda5a335b6e943c4c1f4c1c392b079e2a1c75", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T170738375872Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ba8cc9213fbf094de4810410794ec78cd3bb5f4ab8dfe66f6c497b0dbc7a24f8"}}}
